s, Budget 2025, Share Market on Budget 2025 and expert advice, on ETMarkets. Also, ETMarkets.com is now on Telegram. For fastest news alerts on financial markets, investment strategies and stocks alerts, subscribe to our Telegram feeds .)\n\nSubscribe to ET Prime and read the Economic Times ePaper Online.and Sensex Tod", "citation": "Gold could top Goldman\u2019s $4,900 forecast as options demand fuels rally \u2014 ET Markets, 2026-08-21. https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/us-stocks/wall-street-guide/gold-could-top-goldmans-4900-forecast-as-options-demand-fuels-rally/articleshow/133408548.cms"}, {"title": "Gold rallies to 3-month high on weaker dollar, bullish technicals", "feed": "ET Markets", "ts": "2026-08-21T15:06:47+00:00", "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/commodities/gold-rallies-to-3-month-high-on-weaker-dollar-bullish-technicals/articleshow/133407758.cms", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "Gold prices soared to a three-month high on Friday, marking its third consecutive weekly increase. This rally was driven by a softer U.S. dollar influenced by Treasury buyback strategies. Analysts identify the surge as a bullish signal after a notable break above significant moving averages. Investors are increasingly attracted to gold and related exchange-traded funds, while other precious metals such as silver and platinum also saw substantial gains.\n\n(What's moving Sensex and Nifty Track latest market news, stock tips, Budget 2025, Share Market on Budget 2025 and expert advice, on ETMarkets. Also, ETMarkets.com is now on Telegram. For fastest news alerts on financial markets, investment s", "citation": "Gold rallies to 3-month high on weaker dollar, bullish technicals \u2014 ET Markets, 2026-08-21. https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/commodities/gold-rallies-to-3-month-high-on-weaker-dollar-bullish-technicals/articleshow/133407758.cms"}, {"title": "Tata Mutual Fund lifts curbs on investment in gold ETFs", "feed": "BusinessLine Mkts", "